Limitation of Benchmarks

    1. Training data contamination
    2. Non Consistently Applied
    3. Too Narrow in Scope
    4. Hard to measure nuanced reasoning
    5. Saturation
    6. Overfitting

    And one new concern, not yet proven
    > Frontier LLMs may be aware that they are being evaluated so they changes their behaviour.